// Package contextwindow decides which part of the chat history the model sees on each turn.
//
// ChatContext holds the messages and a window strategy (full history, last N messages, token budget, ...), plus
// summarize/compact support. After any trim the window must start at a user message, so a tool result is never
// left without the assistant call that produced it.
